## 1. Executive Strategy — Final Pre-Production Postponement

To ensure rapid, unblocked development and eliminate accidental quota exhaustion:
1. **Live Media Processing & Subtitle Rendering:** Postponed to the final pre-production gate. Real video upload, Celery background worker hosting (paid Render worker), and live Whisper speech-to-text will only be triggered when the entire web platform (UI, Database, Cloud Storage) is fully ready.
2. **Live Cloud API Inference Testing:** Postponed to the final pre-production gate. Normal local development and CI runs use deterministic `MockAIAdapter` and unit/contract mocks.
3. **Dedicated Provider Segregation:** Each API key has one strictly defined responsibility and never cross-pollinates with others.

